  "yields": "A typical breach in the data exposes about 1,364 records and goes unnoticed for about 91 days, while a few huge breaches pull the average up to 22,774,208. Hacking is the most common kind of attack and outsiders cause most incidents, so CyCRS starts its threat list there.",
